# Build context hygiene: the image only COPYs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/
# and demo/entrypoint.sh, so everything else is bytes the daemon receives for
# nothing — target/ and fuzz/target alone are measured in gigabytes.
.git
target
fuzz
dist
.venv
data
benchmarks/results/raw
**/__pycache__
*.so
*.pyd
.DS_Store
